@ira_small
title: Funding the IRA (Small Quantity)
subtitle: -2 Budget
: land_reform_progress <= 9
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 2 budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; land_reform_progress += 1; rural_psoe += 5*(1-Q.dissent); unemployed -= 0.2; cnt_militancy -= 1 if Q.cnt_militancy > 0; capital_strike_progress += 1; agriculture_goal_completed += 1;

We pour state funds into the *Instituto de Reforma Agraria*. Teams of topographers, lawyers and agrarian engineers are sent across Andalusia and Extremadura to survey estates, register land titles and process legal reparations.

It is a meticulous and impeccably legal process, satisfying the moderate Republicans and protecting the state from legal appeals. However, for many of the starving landless peasants, the IRA's bureaucratic machinery moves agonizingly slow.

@ira_large
title: Funding the IRA (Large Quantity)
subtitle: -3 Budget
: land_reform_progress <= 8
choose-if: budget >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 3 budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 3; land_reform_progress += 2; rural_psoe += 8*(1-Q.dissent); unemployed -= 0.4; cnt_militancy -= 1 if Q.cnt_militancy > 0; capital_strike_progress += 1.5; agriculture_goal_completed += 1;

We pour state funds into the *Instituto de Reforma Agraria*. Teams of topographers, lawyers and agrarian engineers are sent across Andalusia and Extremadura to survey estates, register land titles and process legal reparations.

It is a meticulous and impeccably legal process, satisfying the moderate Republicans and protecting the state from legal appeals. However, for many of the starving landless peasants, the IRA's bureaucratic machinery moves agonizingly slow.

@radical_seizures
title: Legalize Direct Land Occupations
: land_reform_progress <= 8
unavailable-subtitle: The judiciary would never allow this.
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2
on-arrival: land_reform_progress += 1; rural_psoe += 6*(1-dissent); cnt_militancy += 2; coup_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2.5; prrs_relation -= 6; ar_relation -= 6; prr_relation -= 8; caballeristas_dissent -= 5; caballeristas_strenght += 5; coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_republican_socialist_conjunction or in_left_republican_coalition);  unemployed -= 0.6; agriculture_goal_completed += 1;

Unable or unwilling to pay large reparations to wealthy aristocrats, we issue a decree legalizing the immediate temporary occupation of uncultivated or neglected fields by agrarian unions.

The landless peasants celebrate this revolutionary measure but it breaks the consensus of the Republican coalition. The Radical Party and moderate socialists denounce the violation of private property. In the countryside, social peace vanishes: armed landowners form vigilante paramilitaries and CNT anarchists feel emboldened to push for total agrarian collectivism.

@sanjurjo_confiscations
title: Confiscate the Estates of Conspirators
: sanjurjada_seen == 1 and sanjurjada_confiscations == 0 and land_reform_progress <= 9
on-arrival: sanjurjada_confiscations = 1; land_reform_progress += 1; rural_psoe += 6*(1-Q.dissent); budget += 1; ejercito_loyalty -= 0.05; 

Taking advantage of the failed monarchist coup led by General Sanjurjo, we pass legislation to confiscate without compensation all landed estates belonging to the nobility and military officers involved in the *Sanjurjada*.

This provides the IRA with hundreds of thousands of fields at zero financial cost to the Treasury.

@agricultural_credit
title: Rural Credit & Grain Price Stabilization
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 1 budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; state_buyer = 1; rural_psoe -= 2; smallholders_ap -= 3*(1-dissent); smallholders_agrarios -= 3*(1-dissent); smallholders_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); rural_policy += 2;
max-visits: 1

We establish subsidized rural credit cooperatives and set minimum floor prices for wheat. While this helps smallholders in northern Spain, it does little to solve the structural crisis of the southern landless peasants. 

@irrigation_projects
title: Expand Irrigation Networks & Hydraulic Works
subtitle: -1 Budget — Transform drylands (*secano*) into irrigated farmland (*regadío*).
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 1 budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; irrigation_developed += 1; economic_growth += 0.2; smallholders_ap -= 3*(1-dissent); smallholders_agrarios -= 3*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 0.3; middle_psoe += 3*(1-Q.dissent); rural_psoe -= 3*(1-Q.dissent); rural_pce += 3; land_reform_progress += 0.5 if land_reform_progress <= 9.5; smallholders_psoe += 10; cnt_militancy += 0.5
max-visits: 2

We launch major hydraulic projects: dams, canals and reservoir expansion to transform arid regions into fertile irrigated lands.

This policy boosts agricultural productivity, creates thousands of construction jobs for rural laborers and wins praise from moderate smallholders and engineers. However, transforming ecosystems and building infrastructure takes years; hungry jornaleros in Andalusia demand immediate access to land today not canals tomorrow.
